<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome - RT 04 RW 18 Kota Baru Arjasari</title>
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/Logo%20aplikasi%20KBA%200418.png" type="image/x-icon">
  
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            brand: {
              50: '#eff6ff', 100: '#dbeafe', 200: '#bfdbfe',
              300: '#93c5fd', 400: '#60a5fa', 500: '#3b82f6',
              600: '#2563eb', 700: '#1d4ed8', 800: '#1e40af', 900: '#1e3a8a',
            }
          },
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
            display: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
</head>
<body class="font-sans text-slate-900 bg-slate-50 min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <nav class="w-full bg-white border-b border-slate-200 px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <img src="/images/Logo%20aplikasi%20KBA%200418.png" alt="Logo KBA 0418" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-slate-100 bg-white">
      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-lg">RT 04 RW 18 Kota Baru Arjasari</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div>
      <% if (user) { %>
      <a href="/portal" class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 hover:bg-brand-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors">Go to Portal</a>
      <% } else { %>
      <a href="/auth/login" class="text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 px-5 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-sm">Sign In</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-2xl w-full relative flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-48 h-48 bg-brand-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-30 animate-blob"></div>
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-48 h-48 bg-blue-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-30 animate-blob animation-delay-2000"></div>
      
      <!-- Big Logo Hero -->
      <div class="mb-6 relative z-10">
        <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-slate-200 p-2 shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/images/Logo%20aplikasi%20KBA%200418.png" alt="Logo KBA 0418" class="w-20 h-20 object-contain rounded-2xl">
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6 relative">Sistem Informasi</h2>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6 relative">
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-blue-500">RT 04 RW 18 KBA</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed relative font-medium">
        Layanan warga terpadu khusus untuk warga RT 04 RW 18 Kota Baru Arjasari. Mengelola administrasi, kas, dan laporan warga dengan lebih transparan.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/50 relative z-10 text-left w-full">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-900">
          <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-500"></i> Fitur Utama
        </h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
            <i data-lucide="users" class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-900">Manajemen Warga</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Organisasi data warga yang rapi</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
            <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-900">Akses Aman</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Pembagian role dan hak akses</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
            <i data-lucide="wallet" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-900">Transparansi Kas</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Pantau iuran bulanan warga</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
            <i data-lucide="file-text" class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-900">Layanan Dokumen</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Pengajuan surat menyurat digital</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-12">
        <% if (user) { %>
        <a href="/portal" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-all shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 hover:scale-105">
          Masuk ke Portal <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
        </a>
        <% } else { %>
        <a href="/auth/login" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-all shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 hover:scale-105">
          Mulai Sekarang <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
        </a>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="py-6 text-center text-sm text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-200 bg-white">
    &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> RT 04 RW 18 Kota Baru Arjasari. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

  <script>
    lucide.createIcons();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
